{"id":"n71363-3-9","stage":1,"title":"짧다 · 短","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71363-3-9-1","ko":"언니, 잠깐 나랑 얘기 좀 해.","zh":"姐姐，麻烦你稍微和我说几句话吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언니,","meaning":"姐姐，大姐","explanation":"언니：姐姐，大姐","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"3","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠깐","meaning":"一下，暂时地","explanation":"잠깐：一下，暂时地","readings":[{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57313","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠깐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나랑","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얘기","meaning":"谈话，说话","explanation":"얘기：谈话，说话","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐，大姐","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"4e073566099677ea","term":"잠깐","zh":"一下，暂时地","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3","entryId":"57313","definition":"在非常短暂的时间内。","pronunciation":["잠깐"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","